config LNET_EFALND
	tristate "AWS EFA LND (kefalnd)"
	depends on LNET && INFINIBAND && INFINIBAND_EFA
	default n
	help
	  The efa LND (kefalnd) carries LNet traffic over the AWS Elastic
	  Fabric Adapter using the EFA verbs provider.

	  To compile this as a kernel module, choose M here and it will be
	  called kefalnd.

	  If unsure, say N.
